    <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="Audio Enviroment Composing" id="id-17d60780ec164a7da4f0f7844ab4b0c7">
      <documentation>Compose audio environment from hierarchy of scenes. Scenes constis of ambient and one-shot sounds. Provides ways to trigger one-shot sounds, play one or many audio track in isolation from the rest of the scene, to configure individual parameter overrides for tracks per each scene.</documentation>
    </element>
    <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessInterface" name="Audio Listening" id="id-521c4e09dfd74633a0e2f69590ccd8a9">
      <documentation>Allows to listen to the audio scene mix and adjust playback volume. </documentation>
    </element>
